= Recommendations <ch:recommendations>

== Continue and Extend the Scheme

We recommend that the scheme be funded permanently and extended with two stations at the student village,
which is the largest group of residents without a station within 300 m. Experience elsewhere suggests that
use grows with the number of places a scheme connects @shaheen2010bikesharing.

== Move the Two Least-Used Stations

The stations at the sports centre and the north car park should be moved. Both are within 150 m of a busier
station, so they add little. Moving them costs less than buying new docks and would supply the two stations
proposed for the student village.

== Review After One Academic Year

The committee should ask for a short review after the first full academic year of the extended scheme, using
the same three measures so that the figures in @ch:results can be compared directly.

== Risks

- *Maintenance.* A fifth of the fleet needed a repair during the pilot. The lease should include a fixed
  response time for repairs.
- *Winter use.* Use in December and January was a third of that in October. Costs per trip will look worse if
  judged on winter months alone.
- *Theft and damage.* Four bicycles were lost. This is low, but the railway station dock is unlit and should
  be moved under the existing canopy.
